:\n- A: Label 2...\n- B: Label 1... but text is wrong.\n- C: **1.0** -> This selects statement 1.\n- D: 3.0\n- E: Label 2...\n- F: Label 1... but text is wrong.\n- G: Label 2...\n- H: 2.0\n- I: Label 1... but text is wrong.\n\nOption C corresponds to statement 1 being the correct answer.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
