    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: suzie ’ s discount footwear sells all pairs of shoes for one price and all pairs of boots for another price . on monday the store sold 22 pairs of shoes and 16 pairs of boots for $ 540 . on tuesday the store sold 8 pairs of shoes and 32 pairs of boots for $ 720 . how much more do pairs of boots cost than pairs of shoes at suzie ’ s discount footwear ?\n\nOptions: \nA. 12\nB. 11\nC. 10\nD. 15\nE. 16\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
