    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To calculate the entropy $H$, we use the formula $H = -\\sum p_i \\log_2(p_i)$.\nGiven probabilities of $1/4, 1/4, 1/8, 1/8, 1/8, 1/8$:\n$H = - [2 \\times (\\frac{1}{4} \\log_2 \\frac{1}{4}) + 4 \\times (\\frac{1}{8} \\log_2 \\frac{1}{8})]$\n$H = - [2 \\times (\\frac{1}{4} \\times -2) + 4 \\times (\\frac{1}{8} \\times -3)]$\n$H = - [-1 - 1.5] = 2.5$ bits/message.\n\nThe correct option is I.\n\n\\boxed{I}",
