    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Use Fouriertransformmethods to find the time-domain responseof a network having a system function [(j2\\omega) / (1 + 2j\\omega)], ifthe input is V(t) =cost (For asinusodialinputcost, the Fourier transform is \\pi[\\delta (\\omega + 1) + \\delta (\\omega - 1)] ).\n\nOptions: \nA. (4/5)cost - (2/5) sin t\nB. (3/4)cost - (1/4)sint\nC. (2/5)cost + (4/5) sin t\nD. cost + sint\nE. (3/5)cost + (1/5)sint\nF. (4/5)cost + (2/5) sin t\nG. (1/5)cost - (3/5)sint\nH. (1/2)cost + (1/2)sint\nI. (1/3)cost - (2/3)sint\nJ. (2/5)cost - (4/5) sin t\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
