    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Calculate the total electric potential energy of a thin spherical conducting shell of radius R and carrying charge q.\n\nOptions: \nA. {{2q^2 / (4\\pi\\epsilon_0R)}} joules\nB. {{q^2 / (2\\pi\\epsilon_0R)}} joules\nC. {{q^2R / (4\\pi\\epsilon_0)}} joules\nD. {{q^2 / (4\\pi\\epsilon_0)}} joules\nE. {{q^2 / (16\\pi\\epsilon_0R)}} joules\nF. {{q^2 / (4\\pi\\epsilon_0R^2)}} joules\nG. {{q^3 / (8\\pi\\epsilon_0R^2)}} joules\nH. {{q^2 / (8\\pi\\epsilon_0R)}} joules\nI. {{q^2 / (π\\epsilon_0R)}} joules\nJ. {{q^2 / (4\\pi\\epsilon_0R)}} joules\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
