      "generated_answer": "Based on the context, Helen Chester is identified as the niece of Judge Arthur Chester, who was recently appointed as the first federal judge for the Alaska Territory. Therefore, the person appointed to this position was Judge Arthur Chester.\n\n\\boxed{Judge Arthur Chester}",
