    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\nThe women wear burka-like coverings to conceal their identities and protect themselves from potential harm or exploitation by the mysterious group involved in the street incidents. The coverings also allow them to move more freely and anonymously while performing their unknown tasks or objectives. Additionally, the masks may serve as a symbol of solidarity or a uniform for their group, emphasizing their shared purpose or identity.",
