      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{Megamind uses a sun-powered death ray to successfully obliterate Metro Man, whom he believed to be his only weakness due to copper. Following this defeat, Megamind takes over Metro City, although his victory is short-lived as he finds life meaningless without a hero to fight.}",
